    "body": "Same problem here. You can't create the `Window` until the realm is at least partially initialized; creating needs to happen as a \"callback\" inside InitializeHostDefinedRealm, as it did before. (You have an open issue on ecma262 to formalize the \"callbackness\" here, but IMO it is fine as is.)\n",
